{:tier :glm-5.2, :verse 25, :comments ["From the El of your father — all this comes to you. And He will help you." "Blessings of the deep — that the deep rises and waters the land." "Blessings of breasts — that the breasts will not shrivel and the children will not die for lack of milk." "And womb — and even inside the womb the fetuses will not die. And regarding the matter of the curse it is written in reverse: ״Give them a miscarrying womb,״ and even when they grow the breasts will be shriveled — not only this but also this."], :book :genesis, :voice :rashbam, :lang :en, :chapter 49, :notes {}, :source-witnesses [{"versionTitle" "Sefaria community Hebrew (PD)", "language" "he"}], :timestamp "2026-07-30T14:47:50.490165444Z", :translated-from :he, :model "glm-5.2"}